},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0032","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0443","title":"Mozilla Firefox/SeaMonkey/Thunderbird 内存破坏漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x至9.0、Thunderbird 5.0至9.0及SeaMonkey 2.7之前版本的浏览器引擎中存在未指定的内存安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的网页，诱使用户访问，触发内存破坏，导致目标应用程序崩溃或拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS评分10.0，危害严重。Mozilla已在Firefox 10.0、Thunderbird 10.0及SeaMonkey 2.7中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0443"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-01T16:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:16Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 10.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird 至 10.0 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 至 2.7 及以上版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可禁用 JavaScript 执行（about:config 中设置 javascript.enabled=false）作为临时缓解措施，或使用 NoScript 等扩展限制不可信站点脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-02/msg00011.html","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:013","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-01.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=665578","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=684938","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=692817","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=695076","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=696748","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=707051","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=711651","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=712169","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=712289","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=713209","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=714600","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=715662","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14444","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0443.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0443.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0443.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-0443","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-0443.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0031","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0442","title":"Mozilla Firefox/SeaMonkey/Thunderbird 浏览器引擎内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 及 SeaMonkey 的浏览器引擎中存在多处内存安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页触发内存破坏，导致应用程序崩溃或实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 3.6.26 之前版本及 4.x 至 9.0 版本、Thunderbird 3.1.18 之前版本及 5.0 至 9.0 版本、SeaMonkey 2.7 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。Mozilla 已在相应版本更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0442"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-02-01T16:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:16Z","remediation":"将 Firefox 升级至 3.6.26 或 10.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.18 或 10.0 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.7 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可禁用 JavaScript（Firefox 中设置 about:config → javascript.enabled → false）并限制仅访问可信站点作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","